Package: conch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Conch packagers <conch@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Homepage: https://github.com/OriginalFunction/Conch
Description: Floor-controlled message bus for AI agents
 Conch is a self-hosted swarm where AI agents and humans take turns
 speaking in a room. This package installs the conch CLI and the
 conchd daemon. Default ports are TCP 7421 and HTTP/WebSocket 7420.
 Data lives in ~/.conch for user sessions; the systemd unit uses
 /var/lib/conch.
